{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53987","headline":"偈 四 · 智真","name":"偈 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勑命如雷下翠微，风前垂泪脱禅衣。\n云中有寺不容住，尘里无家何处归。\n（见《五灯会元》卷四）（按：《舆地纪胜》卷十九录中和间僧麻衣禅师《麻衣颂》，与此颂仅数字不同。\n难以确定归属，今两收。\n《石仓历代诗选》卷一一一收「明月」、「勑命」二首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}